{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3020648f-c96c-8da9-b08a-558039b993f0",
  "created_at": "2025-12-05T11:42:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Walter G. Wilcox",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:39:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, sorry, I know this is silly, but I'm not sure if I've got the right department. I've got a limb hanging over the sidewalk and I don't know who to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:39:49-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's not silly at all. You're a little choppy, I'm sorry. A limb hanging over the sidewalk, did you say?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:39:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, sorry, I'm in a bad spot for reception. A big limb, it's hanging down over the sidewalk, came down in the nor'easter. The one that's hitting today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it came down in the storm that's going on now. Is it still attached to the tree, or is it on the ground?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:40:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's still stuck up in the tree, kind of hanging. [line breaks up] ...so people walking by would be right under it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:40:21-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I lost you for a second there. You said people would be walking right under it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:40:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Sorry. And what I really want to know is who handles it. Is it the city, or is it me as the owner, or the utility company? I honestly don't know whose it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:40:38-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. It depends on where the tree is. If it's a city street tree out by the sidewalk, that's us. If it's on your property, it's generally the owner's. And if the limb is touching or near a power line, you'd want to call the electric utility and stay well clear of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:40:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, I think it's not near the wires. The tree's in the front yard, but the limb is over the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:41:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Can I get the address so I can note it down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:41:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sorry. It's 276 Malbone Road, in the North End."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:41:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "276 Malbone Road. And is the tree on your side of the sidewalk, back toward the house, or out by the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:41:20-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[inaudible] ...back toward the house, I think. Sorry, I'm about to head out. I'm picking up a new pair of glasses today, so I'm not seeing the best right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:41:30-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Well, if it's back on your side, it's most likely yours to deal with, but I'll put in a report so someone can look at it, and they can tell you for sure. During the storm the crews are busy with the bigger emergencies, so it may be a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:41:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine, sorry. Should I do something in the meantime?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:41:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just keep people away from under it if you can, and don't try to pull it down yourself in this wind. Can I have a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:42:01-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sorry. It's 401-555-0177."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:42:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0177, and that's Mr. Wilcox, 276 Malbone Road, limb hanging over the sidewalk. Do I have that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:42:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Thank you, sorry for the trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-05T11:42:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No trouble. Stay safe out there."
    }
  ],
